Package: researchR
Title: Client for a Self-Hosted 'researchd' Literature Surveillance Server
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-10-30
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller",
 email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
 role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: An R client for 'researchd', a self-hosted literature and
 signal surveillance server. Configures surveillance questions and reads
 stored literature records, signals, source health and service heartbeats
 through a token-authenticated REST API. Returns typed 'tibble' objects,
 including source provenance where supported by the server. Collection,
 classification, source access and delivery are managed by the server.
